' Component overview; boxes name 14 components and dotted links mark external context absent from this checkout.
@startuml
title Components (14 elements)
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "API / RSS sources" as API
component "HTML sources" as HTML
component "ATS boards" as ATS
component "Duapune JSON import" as Import
component "Laptop collector\n(outside checkout)" as Collector
component "CLI\nrun / match / analyze / health\ninit-db / profile set / filter-report / serve" as CLI
database "Postgres + pgvector\n127.0.0.1:5434" as DB
component "Dashboard\n127.0.0.1:8000" as Dashboard
component "Daily timer + service\n07:00 Europe/Tirane" as Timer
component "daily.sh" as Daily
component "Web service" as Web
component "TokenRouter\n(if configured as API base URL)" as Router
actor Browser
component "SSH tunnel\n(outside checkout)" as Tunnel

Collector ..> Import : collect / transfer
Timer --> Daily
Daily --> CLI : run, match, analyze, health
CLI --> API : fetch
CLI --> HTML : fetch
CLI --> ATS : fetch registered boards
CLI --> Import : read
CLI --> DB : store / rank / analyze
CLI ..> Router : embeddings / chat
Web --> CLI : serve
CLI --> Dashboard : start
Dashboard --> DB : queue / reviews / filters
Browser ..> Tunnel
Tunnel ..> Dashboard : forward HTTP

legend bottom
  API / RSS: remoteok, remotive, arbeitnow, himalayas,
  jobicy, weworkremotely, hn_hiring.
  HTML: staffal, kosovajob, djinni.
  ATS: Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby, SmartRecruiters.
  Dotted links show external operating context.
endlegend
@enduml
